<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.79 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.35 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.51 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Sales		   23.71 vs  17.83</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.76 vs   1.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.11 vs   1.91</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.38 vs   1.72</p>
<p> Sales		   60.42 vs  51.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processor is Sokolowskie</p>
<p>Zaklady Miesne Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
